# No input graph can be written for this region, and that is the finding.
#
# The graph it reads -- `Graph().parse(data=get_graph_content(client,
# graph_setup.shapes_iri))` -- is the SHAPES GRAPH THE PLUGIN JUST WROTE into
# a live eccenca Corporate Memory deployment, read back over HTTP.  Its
# `dcterms:created` stamp is produced by that deployment at execution time and
# is asserted against DATETIME_PATTERN *before* being removed, so a fixture
# standing in for it would be validating a double of the plugin rather than
# the region.  See driver.py and meta.json: classification "excluded".
